{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;This Demo lets you produce and trade with the limited version of Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator. Complete your fun Farming &amp; Supermarket experience by adding the full game to your wishlist!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow, Harvest, Use</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make the best use of your harvested products: either fill the supermarket shelves or use them as feed for your animals. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif2.gif?t=1743316581\" /><strong> <br> </strong>Feed and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong>Feed your animals and reap the rewards! Feed your chicken a tomato, collect fresh eggs, and enjoy the fruits of your labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif3.gif?t=1743316581\" /><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Invest in Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your production by purchasing machines! Process your harvested goods to produce valuable items for your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif4.gif?t=1743316581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cashier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly scan items, accept payments in cash or credit, and ensure your customers leave happy with their shopping experience!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif6.gif?t=1743316581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Work Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly move your product crates to the market, fill the shelves, and meet your customers' demands!<strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif5.gif?t=1743316581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Supermarket Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your supermarket with the money you earn! More space, more products, and more customers mean more sales. Strategically organize your shelves and highlight popular products.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif1.gif?t=1743316581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offer the products you collect to customers in your supermarket. Build a loyal customer base by increasing customer satisfaction. Grow your supermarket by making strategic plans and attract more customers by offering the best service.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3479320?t=1743316581","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743316581","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/864ce6f10932515c4216426ce2d37be761ec8669/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743316581","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/864ce6f10932515c4216426ce2d37be761ec8669/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743316581","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;This Demo lets you produce and trade with the limited version of Farming &amp; Supermarket Simulator. Complete your fun Farming &amp; Supermarket experience by adding the full game to your wishlist!&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Grow, Harvest, Use</h2></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Make the best use of your harvested products: either fill the supermarket shelves or use them as feed for your animals. The choice is yours!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif2.gif?t=1743316581\" /><strong> <br> </strong>Feed and Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong></strong>Feed your animals and reap the rewards! Feed your chicken a tomato, collect fresh eggs, and enjoy the fruits of your labor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif3.gif?t=1743316581\" /><strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Invest in Machines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your production by purchasing machines! Process your harvested goods to produce valuable items for your supermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif4.gif?t=1743316581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Cashier</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly scan items, accept payments in cash or credit, and ensure your customers leave happy with their shopping experience!<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif6.gif?t=1743316581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><br>Work Smart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quickly move your product crates to the market, fill the shelves, and meet your customers' demands!<strong></strong><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif5.gif?t=1743316581\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Supermarket Expansion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Grow your supermarket with the money you earn! More space, more products, and more customers mean more sales. Strategically organize your shelves and highlight popular products.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/extras/gif1.gif?t=1743316581\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Offer the products you collect to customers in your supermarket. Build a loyal customer base by increasing customer satisfaction. Grow your supermarket by making strategic plans and attract more customers by offering the best service.</p>","developers":["Bull Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3070880","name":"Farming & Supermarket Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3479320/header.jpg?t=1743316581","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257090704,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090704/movie480.mp4?t=1740165522","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090704/movie_max.mp4?t=1740165522"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257090704/fe7274c8b4fb05c4fbecec61799b2c0c1488e3bc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1740165522","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090704/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1740165522","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257090704/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1740165522"}}],"name":"Farming & Supermarket Simulator Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RA